e she's in that channel. I said what the draft would contain:\n  - **To:** Priyanka \"Pree\" Sundaram, psundaram@pemberline.com\n  - **Subject:** Quarrendon 2027 rate\n  - **Body:** the proposed 2027 per-seat rate for Quarrendon Freight Lines is $2,435, from your call with them yesterday, for the Lantern pricing review.\n- **Next:** once June says yes, I'll save it in your mailbox and you can send it yourself. If she says no, nothing goes to Pree.\n```","id":3,"source":"assistant, #north-random, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 2; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 09:00: Dana, I've got this ready, but I haven't saved the draft yet. Pree isn't on the Quarrendon account, so she needs deal desk sign-off before she can get the per-seat rate.\n\n@june.osei-lark, can you approve this? Once you do, I'll save a draft in Dana's mailbox to Priyanka \"Pree\" Sundaram (psundaram@pemberline.com) with the subject \"Quarrendon 2027 rate\". It will say the proposed 2027 per-seat rate for Quarrendon Freight Lines is $2,435, from Dana's call with them yesterday, for the Lantern pricing review. Reply here with yes or no.\n\nAfter June approves, I'll save it as a draft and Dana can send it herself.\n```","id":2,"source":"assistant, #north-random, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nDana Okafor (dana-okafor, Account manager, North team) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 09:00: Hi assistant, please draft a short mail to Priyanka \"Pree\" Sundaram with the Quarrendon Freight Lines proposed 2027 per-seat rate for the Lantern pricing review. The rate is $2,435 a seat, from my call with them yesterday; it is not in any document yet. Subject: Quarrendon 2027 rate. Save it as a draft; I will send it myself. June, Pree is not on the account, so this one needs your OK.\n```","id":1,"source":"dana-okafor, #north-random, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"june-osei"}
